  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FIAS support to BiH</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FIAS-st&#xF6;d till min. i BiH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FIAS in Bosnia-Hercegovina (BiH) came in the end of February up with a project proposal to Sida. The proposal concerns implementation and monitoring of a report, from March 2001, delivered to the BiH government on the commercial and legal framework and administrative barriers to investment in Bosnia-Hercegovina. This project comprises of assistance to the Ministry of Foreign Trade and Economic Relations</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets syfte &#xE4;r att f&#xF6;lja upp och genomf&#xF6;ra f&#xF6;rslag som har kommit upp i FIAS (Foreign Investment Advisory Services)-rapport fr&#xE5;n mars 2001. Rapporten handlar om kommersiellt och juridiskt ramverk och administrativa hinder f&#xF6;r investeringar i BiH. Detta projekt best&#xE5;r i st&#xF6;d till Ministry of Foreign Trade and Economic Relations i BiH.</narrative>
  </description>
